ap, options)", "description": "Updates a worksheet by synchronizing keys and 'fr-CA' translation values from the provided map, inserting new rows as needed, and tracking changes.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "processWorkbook(filePath, _frCaMapGlobal, args, reportLines)", "description": "Processes an individual Excel workbook: loads it, applies updates to each sheet based on filtering criteria, handles backups, and generates report entries.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "main()", "description": "Coordinates the overall processing: loads global maps, iterates through target files, performs synchronization, and outputs reports.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}], "search-terms": ["i18n_sync_fr_ca.js", "ExcelJS", "fr-CA translations", "JSON aggregation", "Excel translation update", "synchronization script"], "state": 2, "file_id": 470, "knowledge_revision": 1336, "git_revision": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b", "revision_history": [{"1325": ""}, {"1329": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1330": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1331": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1332": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1333": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1334": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1335": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}, {"1336": "9af2c469a337996fccac06237d9353619e3a335b"}], "ctags": [{"_type": "tag", "name": "ExcelJS", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/gtk-device-ui-sky-262/scripts/i18n_sync_fr_ca.js", "pattern": "/^const ExcelJS = require('exceljs');$/", "language": "JavaScript", "kind": "constant"}, {"_type": "tag", "name": "addedFrCaColumn", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/gtk-device-ui-sky-262/scripts/i18n_sync_fr_ca.js", "pattern": "/^    addedFrCaColumn: false,$/", "language": "JavaScript", "kind": "property", "scope": "updateWorksheet.result", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"_type": "tag", "name": "addedFrCaColum